<view class="page-container theme-{{themeId}} more-page">
  <view class="page-intro more-header">
    <text class="page-kicker">更多</text>
    <text class="page-title">更多</text>
    <text class="page-subtitle">轻量工具和界面偏好放在这里；财务诊断与批量维护继续留在 Desktop。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-header more-tools__header">
    <text class="section-title">轻量工具</text>
    <text class="more-section-hint">Phase 5</text>
  </view>

  <view class="more-tools">
    <view class="surface-card more-tool more-tool--schedule" bindtap="onTapScheduled">
      <view class="more-tool__icon">↻</view>
      <view class="more-tool__copy">
        <view class="more-tool__title-row">
          <text class="more-tool__title">定期记账</text>
          <text class="more-tool__arrow">›</text>
        </view>
        <text class="more-tool__body">管理每月固定收支规则，查看下次日期与最近执行状态。</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="surface-card more-tool more-tool--feedback" bindtap="onTapFeedback">
      <view class="more-tool__icon">✦</view>
      <view class="more-tool__copy">
        <view class="more-tool__title-row">
          <text class="more-tool__title">产品反馈</text>
          <text class="more-tool__arrow">›</text>
        </view>
        <text class="more-tool__body">记录哪里不顺手、哪里不清楚，也可以查看和重新打开已有反馈。</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="theme-section">
    <view class="section-header theme-section__header">
      <text class="section-title">界面配色</text>
      <text class="theme-section__hint">保存在当前微信客户端</text>
    </view>

    <view class="theme-grid">
      <view
        wx:for="{{themeOptions}}"
        wx:key="id"
        class="theme-option {{themeId === item.id ? 'theme-option--active' : ''}}"
        data-theme="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="onSelectTheme"
      >
        <view class="theme-option__swatches">
          <view class="theme-option__swatch" style="background: {{item.swatchA}};"></view>
          <view class="theme-option__swatch" style="background: {{item.swatchB}};"></view>
          <view class="theme-option__swatch" style="background: {{item.swatchC}};"></view>
        </view>
        <view class="theme-option__copy">
          <view class="theme-option__title-row">
            <text class="theme-option__name">{{item.label}}</text>
            <text wx:if="{{themeId === item.id}}" class="theme-option__selected">使用中</text>
          </view>
          <text class="theme-option__description">{{item.description}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>